{"id":"0857d6ab104a439b","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-dstr.md","title":"Turing度结构","display":"df-dstr — Turing度结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-dstr","aliases":["43-df-dstr"],"display":"df-dstr — Turing度结构","depends_on":["[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-thm-jump-monotone]]","[[43-thm-turing-join-lub]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.4.1, print pp.13–15 / PDF pp.33–35","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-dstr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-dstr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dstr — Turing度结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ede62d90d5d2c527\" href=\"?note=ede62d90d5d2c527\" title=\"43-thm-jump-monotone\">43-thm-jump-monotone</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"776f51b54a824ba6\" href=\"?note=776f51b54a824ba6\" title=\"43-thm-turing-join-lub\">43-thm-turing-join-lub</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.4.1, print pp.13–15 / PDF pp.33–35"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T,\\le_T,\\oplus,A&#39;,\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\equiv_T,\\le_T,\\oplus,A&#39;,\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span> 采用所列本目录依赖；集合论元语言中构造等价类与商结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{deg}(A):=\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:A\\equiv_TB\\},\\qquad\\mathcal D:=\\{\\operatorname{deg}(A):A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{deg}(A):=\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:A\\equiv_TB\\},\\qquad\\mathcal D:=\\{\\operatorname{deg}(A):A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b\\iff\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;A\\le_TB.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b\\iff\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;A\\le_TB.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;C\\equiv_TA\\oplus B\\},\\qquad\\mathbf a&#39;:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;C\\equiv_TA&#39;\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;C\\equiv_TA\\oplus B\\},\\qquad\\mathbf a&#39;:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;C\\equiv_TA&#39;\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{deg}(A)\\le\\operatorname{deg}(B)\\iff A\\le_TB,\\qquad\\operatorname{deg}(A)\\vee\\operatorname{deg}(B)=\\operatorname{deg}(A\\oplus B),\\qquad\\operatorname{deg}(A)&#39;=\\operatorname{deg}(A&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{deg}(A)\\le\\operatorname{deg}(B)\\iff A\\le_TB,\\qquad\\operatorname{deg}(A)\\vee\\operatorname{deg}(B)=\\operatorname{deg}(A\\oplus B),\\qquad\\operatorname{deg}(A)&#39;=\\operatorname{deg}(A&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D,\\qquad\\mathbf a&#39;\\in\\mathcal D,\\qquad\\mathbf0:=\\operatorname{deg}(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\operatorname{CEDegree}(\\mathbf a)\\iff\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\operatorname{CE}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D,\\qquad\\mathbf a&#39;\\in\\mathcal D,\\qquad\\mathbf0:=\\operatorname{deg}(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\operatorname{CEDegree}(\\mathbf a)\\iff\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\operatorname{CE}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>集合构造本身不选择代表。Turing等价关系、join的最小上界性质及跳跃单调性保证这些集合分别仍为单个度；对应关系与闭合性已在Assertion明确列出。c.e.度只需含有一个c.e.代表。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§5.4.1, print pp.13–15 / PDF pp.33–35。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-jump-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"ede62d90d5d2c527","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-jump-monotone]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-turing-join-lub","status":"resolved","id":"776f51b54a824ba6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-turing-join-lub]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_T,\\le_T,\\oplus,A',\\operatorname{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{deg}(A):=\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:A\\equiv_TB\\},\\qquad\\mathcal D:=\\{\\operatorname{deg}(A):A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b\\iff\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;A\\le_TB.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;C\\equiv_TA\\oplus B\\},\\qquad\\mathbf a':=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;C\\equiv_TA'\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{deg}(A)\\le\\operatorname{deg}(B)\\iff A\\le_TB,\\qquad\\operatorname{deg}(A)\\vee\\operatorname{deg}(B)=\\operatorname{deg}(A\\oplus B),\\qquad\\operatorname{deg}(A)'=\\operatorname{deg}(A').","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D,\\qquad\\mathbf a'\\in\\mathcal D,\\qquad\\mathbf0:=\\operatorname{deg}(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\operatorname{CEDegree}(\\mathbf a)\\iff\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\operatorname{CE}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":2035,"backlinks":[{"id":"a9b82ac5305584a4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{deg}$ 见 [[43-df-dstr]]；$\\chi_A$ 是A的特征函数，$\\varnothing'$ 为停机集。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-dstr]] — Turing度结构"},{"id":"55d889c1e98eddc1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-dstr]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。"},{"id":"0c9aef3f96f3e90f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{deg}$ 是 [[43-df-dstr]] 的Turing度映射；$\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}$ 见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}$ 见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]。所有集合均属于 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$。"}],"outgoing":["0784d1de3a88cd94","be1278f108eb178d","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","6c0559518cd32104","ede62d90d5d2c527","776f51b54a824ba6"]}